WEBVTT

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:06.840
TAMAZUSA

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.590
(Hakkenshi)
 EIGHT DOG WARRIORS

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:12.810
Long ago, Tamazusa plunged this 
country into the Dark Ages.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.390
In the battle to defeat her, 
the eight young men who

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:19.300
fought alongside Princess Fuse perished.

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.240
PRINCESS FUSE

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:29.940
PRINCESS FUSE

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.950
Princess Fuse sealed Tamazusa's soul,

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.870
which had turned into an 
evil spirit, inside her body

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:29.900
before plunging a blade 
into her own chest.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:35.100
When she did, eight gems flew 
to the men's next lives.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:38.010
Princess Fuse infused 
the gems with the wish,

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:42.910
"If these eight individuals should ever 
gather together in their future lives,

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.100
"I shall come back to life...

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.340
"...and grant their wishes."

00:02:30.230 --> 00:02:34.380
I... don't want to...

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.790
...die...

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.960
Today is Meatday, tomorrow is Meatday.

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:54.640
Episode 14: Doll

00:02:52.960 --> 00:02:54.810
BBQ in the mornin'.

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:56.460
Hot pot at noon.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.050
A slab'll do me just 
fine in the evening.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.750
Every chunk of meat is a 
beautifully marbled steak.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:15.670
Marbled Steak! Marbled 
steak! Marbled steak!.

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:06.630
Shino, you've been singing 
that song on repeat.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:07.830
What is it called?

00:03:08.310 --> 00:03:10.980
"The Prize High-Grade 
Marbled Beef Song"!

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:13.800
Isn't this area famous for its beef?

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:15.670
I'm drooling already!

00:03:16.530 --> 00:03:19.170
He's got nothing but cows on the brain!

00:03:19.610 --> 00:03:21.980
Without that carrot on the stick,

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:24.700
I doubt Shino would have 
accompanied us willingly.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:30.150
I swear, this manor truly 
is a delight to visit!

00:03:30.150 --> 00:03:34.220
Could you show me around 
the garden later, Rio?

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:38.240
Who is that man?

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:39.690
Beats me.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.540
Master Finnegan, did you 
have a special reason

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:45.200
for coming to visit us in person?

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:52.200
Are you familiar with 
the Imamura doll makers?

00:03:53.270 --> 00:03:57.710
The dolls they sculpt are truly 
magnificent pieces of art.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:03:59.320
Dolls...?

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:03.720
They have been toiling away in 
some isolated mountain of late.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.140
And that's just it...

00:04:05.890 --> 00:04:06.720
Sir?

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.690
I commissioned a set of 
dolls with this doll maker.

00:04:10.690 --> 00:04:12.850
Could you retrieve it for me?

00:04:13.340 --> 00:04:15.600
You'll go, now won't you?

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.670
Sir?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.800
You can hardly turn down a request 
from an elite member of the Church...

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.280
He doesn't realize how his 
actions affect others...

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:27.870
That still doesn't explain 
why Genpachi's taggin' along.

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:31.980
Mr. Inumura and Kona-ya's 
inkeeper are old acquaintances.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.520
And here I brought a letter 
she wrote introducing you!

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:38.770
You really do give me the 
cold shoulder, Shino!

00:04:39.020 --> 00:04:40.880
Nah, this is normal.

00:04:48.370 --> 00:04:49.540
A cherry blossom...?

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:52.750
Wow!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:56.750
But it's autumn...

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:58.540
What an odd sight.

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:02.680
One, two, three, four

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:07.410
I gaze upon spring landscapes 
no matter where I look

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:11.890
There are plums and a bush 
warbler chirps, "Hohon hokekyo"

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:14.050
Oh, how it chirps

00:05:14.770 --> 00:05:15.880
That's strange...

00:05:16.770 --> 00:05:18.260
Did we take a wrong turn?

00:05:18.810 --> 00:05:20.830
But there weren't any turns.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.050
Are you lost?

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:27.700
Excuse me!

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:30.060
Do you know where Mr. 
Inumura's house is?

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.300
It's supposed to be around here.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:35.790
Inumura's residence is just up ahead.

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:43.340
Huh? So that's where it was...

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.460
Thank you.

00:05:56.060 --> 00:05:57.560
Is that right?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:59.730
You came clear from the 
Imperial Capital to

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:01.210
retrieve Master Finnegan's dolls...

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:03.710
Well, please come inside.

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:08.360
Norikiyo Inumura has gone missing.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.930
As such, the dolls are 
currently incomplete

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:12.220
and I cannot hand them over.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.220
What?!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.520
Come now, Brother!

00:06:16.520 --> 00:06:19.940
When you say it like that, 
it comes across as rude!

00:06:20.420 --> 00:06:22.150
Allow me to introduce us.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:24.230
This is my elder brother, Daikaku.

00:06:24.590 --> 00:06:27.240
I am his younger sister, Hinaginu.

00:06:27.630 --> 00:06:30.480
Then you must be Mr. Norikiyo's heir...

00:06:30.800 --> 00:06:32.740
Daikaku Inumura.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:35.250
What's this about him "going missing"?

00:06:36.350 --> 00:06:40.160
About half a year ago, our 
father suddenly vanished.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:44.320
We've searched everywhere, but 
we still can't find him...

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:47.130
I never knew...

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.250
I imagine it must be hard on you.

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.260
But we cannot go back empty handed.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:56.810
Mr. Daikaku, perhaps you could 
complete the dolls in his stead?

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:00.270
That's impossible. Now please leave.

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.170
Wait! Aren't you his son?

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.540
You've gotta do somethin'!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:06.280
The payment's already been made!

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:08.760
You're a doll maker, aren't you?

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:11.160
What?!

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:19.180
Pa is the only one capable 
of finishing those dolls!

00:07:20.230 --> 00:07:21.670
H-hey!

00:07:22.220 --> 00:07:26.570
I am sorry. He is a rather proud artist.

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.050
And he can be quite aloof...

00:07:28.780 --> 00:07:32.490
If you like, you are welcome 
to stay for a while.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:35.990
Yay! Marbled beef!

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.790
Whoa, there. Rein yourself in.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:39.640
Would you like this, Shino?

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.690
Too good!

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:42.790
Damn it, Murasame!

00:07:53.720 --> 00:07:55.640
You're a doll maker, aren't you?

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:00.580
What would you know!

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.230
No matter how many times I 
try, they all end in failure!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:22.120
If Pa saw me now, what would he say...?

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:28.480
As of today, you are my son.

00:08:31.050 --> 00:08:33.740
Good. Well done, Daikaku!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:48.400
You're still up?

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:52.730
Hinaginu, where do you think Pa went?

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:59.580
Knowing the way he loved 
and cherished dolls,

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:02.440
surely he still wants to make them.

00:09:03.040 --> 00:09:04.390
So why...?

00:09:05.830 --> 00:09:11.050
Does it have anything to do 
with when that man came...?

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:15.280
Doncha think it's 'bout 
time ya gave Daikaku back?

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:19.510
He's bringin' in cash as 
a doll maker, ain't he?

00:09:19.640 --> 00:09:22.950
It's high time he started to 
look after his real father!

00:09:24.140 --> 00:09:26.120
How could you say that 
after all this time?

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.290
Daikaku is my son now!

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:38.240
Please! Take these and leave.

00:09:41.410 --> 00:09:46.500
I believe that must have been 
truly humiliating for Father...

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:49.190
But I doubt that is the reason why...

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:53.330
Lately, I've been having 
dreams about back then.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:55.600
Horrible dreams...

00:09:56.300 --> 00:10:00.300
But for some reason, cherry 
blossoms always come to my rescue.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:03.280
You must be tired.

00:10:04.350 --> 00:10:05.580
You should get some rest.

00:10:13.350 --> 00:10:18.110
Really, they reek of 
dog! I can't stand them.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.210
Those are the pets Satomi has raised.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.970
I imagine Finnegan sent them here.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:26.370
But they make for an odd bunch.

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:29.070
There is a dog, a demon, 
and that last one is...

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.080
Wow!

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:09.750
So this is your workshop?

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.270
What are you doing here?

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:16.860
I came to ask again!

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.430
Please hurry and finish up those dolls!

00:11:19.960 --> 00:11:21.270
Going by your attitude,

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:23.510
I never would have guessed 
you came to ask for a favor.

00:11:24.050 --> 00:11:28.290
Then lemme ask you: What 
exactly is the problem?

00:11:29.940 --> 00:11:32.060
Dolls have "faces".

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:33.940
In other words, the doll first

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.510
gains a soul when we carve 
the facial expression.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:39.790
We doll makers devote our 
heart to the client's feelings

00:11:39.790 --> 00:11:41.300
as we seize the chisel...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:44.990
But I cannot see the 
face on those dolls...

00:11:46.290 --> 00:11:47.910
I am confident that Pa could have

00:11:47.910 --> 00:11:50.210
given them the perfect "faces" 
and brought them to completion.

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:52.950
But I am stuck at a 
complete standstill...

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.250
No matter how many faces I make,

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.630
it doesn't feel like 
I'm getting anywhere!

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:01.730
This is beyond me.

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:06.060
You sure are stubborn!

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:08.580
Pa is far more stubborn.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:12.580
Yeah? "Like father like 
son," or so they say.

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.400
I'm his adopted son.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:19.840
Hey, this is cute!

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:23.490
What is this? A dog? Or a cat?

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:24.570
A cat.

00:12:24.570 --> 00:12:26.230
A cat, huh?

00:12:26.230 --> 00:12:27.630
I'd never know it by lookin' at you,

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.630
but you make some cute stuff!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.670
This is cute, too!

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:33.980
Oh, here's a family of cats!

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:39.170
Well, I guess I can wait a bit longer.

00:12:40.130 --> 00:12:40.990
Ouch!

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.490
What was that for?!

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:45.860
Who're you?

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:48.220
Get the heck outta here!

00:12:48.930 --> 00:12:50.020
Hey!

00:12:50.520 --> 00:12:53.290
Jeez! What was his problem?

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:03.150
Hello!

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:07.390
Wow!

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:09.990
Are all of these dolls?

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.210
Talk about intimidating!

00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:25.430
That... face...!

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:28.650
This is...!

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.380
This is...

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:34.930
...the woman who killed us!

00:13:40.650 --> 00:13:41.980
This face...!

00:13:42.650 --> 00:13:44.530
How could I have forgotten until now?

00:13:45.900 --> 00:13:49.810
Five years ago, in that village 
on that fateful day...

00:14:00.460 --> 00:14:03.920
This is the woman who killed us...!

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:13.390
Shino?

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.790
Is something the matter?

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.610
Did you need something?

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.800
Uh, no! It's just, I 
saw that doll and...

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.460
She captivates anyone who sees her.

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.810
Isn't she beautiful?

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:30.030
It's hard to believe she's a doll!

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:33.760
She was made at about the 
same time Mother passed away.

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:36.250
It was as though Father was obsessed.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.690
He was so absorbed in

00:14:37.690 --> 00:14:40.080
making her that he wouldn't 
even stop to eat.

00:14:41.170 --> 00:14:44.500
Hey, I'd appreciate it if 
you could share anything

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.010
you know about this woman.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:49.570
I'm sorry, but this happened 
when I was a small child...

00:14:50.930 --> 00:14:52.060
I see...

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.110
You again?

00:15:06.110 --> 00:15:07.900
Sorry, but do you have a sec?

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:10.330
The model for that doll?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:12.980
Nah, I don't know who she is.

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:15.780
He made that such a long time ago.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:17.250
I see...

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.460
That ball...

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:22.670
A little brat threw it at me earlier!

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:23.680
A child?

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:27.290
I gave this to a cat I used 
to own a long time ago.

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:30.950
Really? You used to have a cat?

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:34.140
It was a long time ago.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.060
What was its name?

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:36.980
Its name...?

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:40.020
I don't think I gave it one...

00:15:40.190 --> 00:15:41.700
Why the hell not?!

00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.410
How'd you call it over to you?

00:15:43.400 --> 00:15:44.880
I never called for it...

00:15:45.400 --> 00:15:48.080
It was always right by my side,

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:49.770
so that was never necessary.

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:53.910
I found it in the crawl space.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.580
I was a quiet lad, so perhaps it was

00:15:57.580 --> 00:16:00.770
out of concern, but Pa 
allowed me to keep the cat.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:09.550
After that, the cat was 
constantly by my side,

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.590
always maintaining a certain distance.

00:16:12.380 --> 00:16:15.930
But then, one day I noticed 
that the cat was gone.

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.410
It is said that a cat

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.750
leaves when it senses 
its impending death,

00:16:21.230 --> 00:16:23.190
so I did not search for him.

00:16:25.650 --> 00:16:26.790
Is that right...?

00:16:27.270 --> 00:16:29.180
Do you like cats?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.990
I like cats, too.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:36.180
But other than Yoshiro, animals 
tend to steer clear of me.

00:16:36.660 --> 00:16:39.660
Oh, for the record, 
Yoshiro is my pet dog!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.430
Then you still have it good.

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:45.250
That cat was the only animal 
that ever approached me.

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.410
With a face like that, no kidding!

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:53.760
Uh, er... My bad.

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:57.000
I got carried away... Daikaku?

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:00.220
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:04.940
Sure thing! I'll do anything I can.

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:09.070
Shino!

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:09.860
Not a word!

00:17:10.380 --> 00:17:12.460
I know what's on the tip of your tongue.

00:17:12.700 --> 00:17:15.990
Shino, were you actually a girl...?

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.530
Dude, you aren't cut out 
for your current job.

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:19.460
Profession: Captain 
of the Military Police

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:19.470
Get a new one.

00:17:20.080 --> 00:17:22.870
Oh, are you modeling for his dolls?

00:17:22.870 --> 00:17:25.730
He has a small face, 
but long arms and legs.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.730
Dolls use the same

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:30.150
unstable features, making 
him the perfect model.

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.480
Just tell them I'm still 
in my growth period!

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:34.550
This reminds me of when 
you were a child, Shino.

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:36.700
I can't wait for you to grow up!

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.500
One, two, three, four

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:54.030
I gaze upon spring landscapes 
no matter where I look

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:58.450
There are plums and a bush 
warbler chirps, "Hohon hokekyo"

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.160
Oh, how it chirps

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.680
It's time you cut that out.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:04.980
Tomorrow at Nikenchaya in Gion

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:05.280
The cherry trees have just 
about reached their limit.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:07.440
Amidst the forest of koto and shamisen

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:11.130
You'll hear some bouncing ball songs

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.310
Your feelings for that 
human will go unnoticed.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:13.590
At Seikanji Temple

00:18:11.310 --> 00:18:13.590
I have proof! Just look.

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.050
The bell tolls five, five, five times

00:18:13.590 --> 00:18:16.050
He can't even remember your name.

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:18.530
The bell tolls six, six, six times

00:18:17.260 --> 00:18:20.510
You will never be rewarded 
for your devotion.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:21.010
The bell tolls seven, seven, seven times

00:18:20.510 --> 00:18:21.780
Never!

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.430
The bell tolls eight, eight, eight times

00:18:23.430 --> 00:18:25.520
The bell tolls nine times, 
which turns to ninety

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:28.040
And then the bell tolls a hundred times

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.540
One, two, three, four

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:33.550
The wind suddenly picked up...

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.310
What was that... just now?!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:54.300
Back then, I was...

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.140
What did that man...?

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:02.160
Brother?

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:05.680
Hinaginu, I just remembered!

00:19:06.680 --> 00:19:10.170
That... That wasn't a dream!

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:20.470
Was I... murdered?!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:23.260
Or was I...

00:19:29.290 --> 00:19:30.680
The wind's picking up.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:33.290
Should I close the shutters?

00:19:33.880 --> 00:19:36.070
Where do you think 
Shino wandered off to?

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:38.690
Why don't we look for him?

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:51.850
Shino!

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:53.960
The cherry blossoms-! The cherry trees-!

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:58.960
Murasame, what's wrong?

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:00.700
Ow!

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:08.330
You again...

00:20:08.330 --> 00:20:10.230
Get the hell away from here!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:13.730
Jeez! Who the heck are you?

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.550
Shino! Are you all right?

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.230
Who's the twerp?

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:20.740
Don't mess with Daikaku!

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:22.930
Otherwise...

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:24.250
...I'll eat you!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:33.810
You, eat us? Right back at you.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:45.780
Wha-?!

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:48.260
My late-night snack! Don't 
think you can escape!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.040
Hey, you!

00:20:52.030 --> 00:20:54.580
Why are you picking on 
this poor li'l dear?!

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:56.540
You're a demon, so you 
ought to know where

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:57.900
to draw the line!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:20:59.310
Are you its boss?

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:02.230
I'm willing to settle for you instead.

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:03.680
It's all the same as 
long as I get to eat.

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.910
Grrr! You sure know how to rub 
me the wrong way, you damn demon!

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:10.470
Do you have any idea who 
you're dealing with here?

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:12.120
Pipe down, Kaede.

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:17.330
Your piercing voice is giving 
me a pounding headache.

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:20.170
You're the old man...

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:22.400
...who was enjoying the flowers.

00:21:22.400 --> 00:21:24.170
Who're you calling an old man?

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:25.400
Goodness, me!

00:21:26.660 --> 00:21:28.330
You might as well be an old fart

00:21:28.330 --> 00:21:30.030
the way you act as if 
you're in retirement!

00:21:30.030 --> 00:21:31.930
And who're you calling 
an old fart, stupid!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:34.250
"Old man" and "old fart" 
are the exact same thing!

00:21:34.370 --> 00:21:37.740
I'm not taking this crap 
from an androgynous cat!

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:39.730
Now I'm pissed!

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:42.420
Sorry for all the fuss.

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:45.750
This is more or less the Hinozuka 
family's guardian deity.

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:48.720
Hinozuka...?

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:51.200
Then you belong to one of the 
Four Houses of the Sacred Beasts?

00:21:51.920 --> 00:21:55.310
I'm Hinozuka, Nachi Hinozuka.

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:40.980
Episode 15: Molding

00:23:27.190 --> 00:23:29.910
Shino, did you go to Mr. 
Daikaku's room again?

00:23:29.910 --> 00:23:31.910
Look! He gave me a papier-mâché cat!

00:23:31.910 --> 00:23:33.620
Don't interfere with his work!

00:23:33.700 --> 00:23:34.910
I'm not gettin' in his way!

00:23:34.910 --> 00:23:37.040
He just treats me like a pet cat anyway.

00:23:37.250 --> 00:23:38.330
A cat...?

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:40.090
But this is "Eight Dogs of the East"
